        "original_id": "299e4c35-1c8d-52a2-b3de-05209ca54936",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Affenpinscher, Villanuco de Las Encartaciones\n- Concepts: dog breeds, alternative names, regional origin\n\nFacts:\n- The Affenpinscher is a terrier-like toy breed of dog.\n- The Affenpinscher is also known as the Monkey Terrier.\n- The Villanuco de Las Encartaciones is a Spanish breed of dog.\n- The Villanuco de Las Encartaciones is typical of Las Encartaciones in Biscay, Cantabria, and northern Burgos in Spain.\n- The Villanuco de Las Encartaciones is called Enkarterriko billanuko in Basque, Villanucu in Cantabrian, and Little Villein of Las Encartaciones in English.",
